{
  "name": "Notify your team about every AI receptionist call with a structured summary",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI receptionist → team notification\nYour Ringee **AI receptionist** answers incoming calls. When a call ends, this workflow reads what the AI learned, shapes it into a clean record and posts it to Slack so nobody has to listen to a recording.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "27e65d20-78e6-5f9e-9eab-edbf1f3c923d",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Before you run this**\n1. In Ringee, create a **Custom Integration** (Integrations → Custom Integrations) and copy its **API key** and **Signing Secret**.\n2. In n8n, create a **Ringee API** credential with both.\n3. Pick your AI voice agent in the Ringee node.\n4. Activate the workflow, then paste the **Ringee Trigger's Production URL** into the integration's **Outbound URL** and tick *Call Completed*.\n\nAssign an AI **Receptionist** agent to a number in Ringee, and connect **Slack**. Tell the receptionist what to collect (name, reason, urgency, callback number); it arrives in *extractedData*.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9d28a7be-a6c9-56a5-8488-7037077ed42b",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Privacy and consent**\nCallers should be told that an AI answers and that the call may be recorded and summarised; many places require consent to record. This workflow copies a summary into Slack, so post only to a private channel your team is allowed to see.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "f41b677e-5550-585b-9db1-03131b1a34d5",
      "name": "Privacy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "call.completed"
        ],
        "options": {
          "onlyAiAgentCalls": true
        }
      },
      "id": "0f9b7138-8fcd-57c7-9799-c014f6c6cad1",
      "name": "Incoming AI call ended",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringeeTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -60
      ],
      "webhookId": "28c06a65-bf18-5e87-9171-e8c19e478c45"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "da47d747-2e9e-53f8-aa44-d5bb0f6721c4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.direction }}",
              "rightValue": "inbound",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8b6226e9-29c3-5709-a65d-5470b8050f7d",
      "name": "Only inbound calls",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        500,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "c33f06a2-da6c-5b77-ba86-af0cae1d43dc",
      "name": "Wait for the AI analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -160
      ],
      "webhookId": "474cf241-2fc6-520d-91aa-259ec128a1d4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "transcript",
        "operation": "getAnalysis",
        "callId": "={{ $('Incoming AI call ended').item.json.data.callId }}"
      },
      "id": "98a618a3-daec-5657-8158-975f0bcb3c7f",
      "name": "Get AI analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "db1dfc19-a38c-50fb-a91f-7e12b742710a",
              "name": "caller",
              "value": "={{ $('Incoming AI call ended').item.json.data.fromNumber }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bc67fdf6-74d3-5542-b54f-9a68cf34c4ee",
              "name": "callerName",
              "value": "={{ $json.extractedData?.name || $json.extractedData?.caller_name || 'Unknown caller' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "26318fbb-b733-5642-9d2e-3f8cfbcd7eb8",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "={{ $json.extractedData?.reason || $json.summary || 'Not captured' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e7569aec-64d1-55db-ac08-8f53223937cc",
              "name": "urgency",
              "value": "={{ $json.ready ? ($json.extractedData?.urgency || 'normal') : 'unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "34b4f424-c545-57f3-9afc-20c49c45e7a2",
              "name": "callbackNumber",
              "value": "={{ $json.extractedData?.callback_number || $('Incoming AI call ended').item.json.data.fromNumber }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "521e880e-4102-5d69-81aa-8edf72ea7ba5",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.ready ? ($json.summary || 'No summary') : 'The analysis is not ready yet: open the call in Ringee.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d158379b-2469-5dc8-9b55-eef6982e3782",
              "name": "sentiment",
              "value": "={{ $json.sentiment || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7336aeae-086b-55ab-a51d-f9269cd3482d",
      "name": "Shape the record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        1220,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#front-desk",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ ($json.urgency === 'high' ? ':rotating_light: ' : $json.urgency === 'unknown' ? ':grey_question: ' : ':telephone_receiver: ') + '*New call from ' + $json.callerName + '*\\nReason: ' + $json.reason + '\\nCall back: ' + $json.callbackNumber + '\\n' + $json.summary }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "6acb6548-80ad-5339-a2dc-f586a50d87c4",
      "name": "Tell the team on Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1460,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cca5e745-3e76-5265-b267-d5a6efd15c61",
      "name": "Skipped: not an inbound call",
